<p>Genre: Horror</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch: This SCP is a gramaphone album that when played will progress the player into dementia if listened to. It has six stages, and each time a song passes the dementia progresses further. For example, a person listening to Stage 1 might forget where his keycard is, and somebody in stage 4 would forget their address or phone number.</p>
<p>Central Narrative: A woman finds this in her house during a garage sale and listens to the entire album. It culminates to an MTF entering her house in the middle of her going through shock and being escorted to the mtf armoured van with the anomaly and her going into a coma on the way to the next site.</p>
