<p>Hey Semantics Romantic, glad you could join the site! Glad to have you here, and don't worry its a learning process. Ask a staff member if you are ever feeling lost on the site, we have many great people on IRC that have quite the knack for solving problems.</p>
<p>For my recommendation, you should check out <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4826">SCP-4826</a></p>
